
=== PART B (+C): build the star schema and load it ===
Creates the tables (sql/01_schema.sql), loads Jan 2022-Nov 2025 (initial load),
then Dec 2025 (incremental load) with the procedure in sql/02_load_batch.sql, and runs the 5 checks.

$ python etl/run_etl.py all
